        "title": "About Anupam Dutta",
        "description": "Anupam Dutta is a passionate wildlife photographer, with a special love for birds and their habitats. His photography journeys span India and international wildlife destinations, with a focus on rare and lesser-known species. His work has been published in wildlife, travel and photography magazines.\nTechnology and business consultant, Partner at Aeka Advisors. Formerly with PwC, IBM and Wipro. Alumnus of Kalyani University and INSEAD Singapore.",
